     Personally, she was on a roll. Financially, she was rapidly going into
debt. Frank and Greg, legal owners of the company, had long since contrib-
uted ideas, contacts, or legwork to the Artemis Images launch. While con-
fident that his work on the business plan would appeal to investors, Greg
viewed the start-up company as a risk to which he was unwilling to com-
mit. Likewise, Frank decided to hold onto his job at Petersons.com, a unit
