      Moving Forward
      Nutraceuticals
      Westphal and Sinclair had a long-running debate over the commercial opportu-
      nity represented by their proprietary formulation of resveratrol (SRT501). Sin-
      clair believed that there would be great public demand for SRT501 long before
      the clinical studies were completed, and that Sirtris, one way or another, should
      start selling SRT501 to the public as a nutraceutical. Sinclair received 30 to 50
      emails a day from people looking to obtain resveratrol.
